# The generated trees are written by Python with newline='\n'. core.autocrlf is
# true on the Windows machine this repo is built from, so without this a fresh
# clone checks them out as CRLF and the next local build rewrites all ~8,000
# files as LF — no git diff, but a very noisy "written/changed" count that hides
# the real changes. Scoped to the generated output only, so nothing else in the
# repo gets renormalized.
/product/** text eol=lf
/brands/** text eol=lf
/look/** text eol=lf
404.html text eol=lf
